    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6805" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cărīno</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a.
		carina, II. B., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to supply with a shell;</i> with <i>se</i>, of mussels, <i>to get shells</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 9, 33,
				52, § 103</span></i>.— Hence, <i>P.
				a.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cărīnātus</span></b> , a,
			um, <i>keelformed</i>, <i>shell-formed</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">concha acatii modo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 30, 49, § 94</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pectus animalium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 37, 82, § 207</span></i>
			.</div>
